    <img class="umb" src="/images/v6/umbrella.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
  </header>
  <main id="main">

  <section class="work wrap" id="r6work" aria-labelledby="r6work-h">
    <div class="shead" data-rv>
      <h2 class="sh" id="r6work-h">Recent work.</h2>
      <p class="sub">Six sites we have built and launched. Each one opens live in a new tab.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="wgrid" data-rv>
      <a class="case" href="https://www.lifecreativewordsministry.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="cimg"><img src="/images/v6/work-lifecreativewords.webp" alt="Life Creative Words Ministry homepage: Where the Word Comes Alive" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ctx"><span class="cm lbl">Church · Vancouver, BC</span><b>Life Creative Words Ministry</b><span class="cd">Service times, sermons and a simple way to plan a first visit.</span><span class="rd">lifecreativewordsministry.com<svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg><span class="vh">(opens in a new tab)</span></span></span></a>
      <a class="case" href="https://www.quickprep.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="cimg"><img src="/images/v6/work-quickprep.webp" alt="Quick Prep homepage: Management Consulting Interview Preparation" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ctx"><span class="cm lbl">Education</span><b>Quick Prep</b><span class="cd">Case and fit interview preparation for management consulting candidates.</span><span class="rd">quickprep.ca<svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg><span class="vh">(opens in a new tab)</span></span></span></a>
      <a class="case" href="https://www.fincwin.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="cimg"><img src="/images/v6/work-fincwin.webp" alt="FincWin homepage: Track what you earn, spend and save" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ctx"><span class="cm lbl">Personal finance app</span><b>FincWin</b><span class="cd">A free budget app that puts income, spending, debt and savings in one view.</span><span class="rd">fincwin.com<svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg><span class="vh">(opens in a new tab)</span></span></span></a>
      <a class="case" href="https://www.freetins.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="cimg"><img src="/images/v6/work-freetins.webp" alt="Freetins homepage: Game codes, sourced and tracked" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ctx"><span class="cm lbl">Gaming guides</span><b>Freetins</b><span class="cd">Game codes and guides, each with a source and the date it was recorded.</span><span class="rd">freetins.com<svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg><span class="vh">(opens in a new tab)</span></span></span></a>
      <a class="case" href="https://www.zamani-foundation.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="cimg"><img src="/images/v6/work-zamani.webp" alt="Zamani Foundation homepage: End Displacement, End Hunger" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ctx"><span class="cm lbl">Non-profit</span><b>Zamani Foundation</b><span class="cd">Advocacy for peace, development and food security for displaced people.</span><span class="rd">zamani-foundation.org<svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg><span class="vh">(opens in a new tab)</span></span></span></a>
      <a class="case" href="https://www.ealch.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="cimg"><img src="/images/v6/work-ealch.webp" alt="EALCH homepage: Pass your French exam without the guesswork" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="ctx"><span class="cm lbl">Language learning</span><b>EALCH</b><span class="cd">Structured preparation for the TEF Canada, TCF, DELF and DALF French exams.</span><span class="rd">ealch.com<svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg><span class="vh">(opens in a new tab)</span></span></span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="who wrap" id="r5who" aria-labelledby="r5who-h">
    <div class="shead" data-rv>
      <h2 class="sh" id="r5who-h">Start with who you are.</h2>
      <p class="sub">Pick the one that sounds like you. The plan, the services and the form below all follow your choice.</p>
    </div>
    <div data-rv>
      <div class="doors" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Who are you">
                  <button type="button" class="door" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-aud="sb" data-slug="small-business" data-label="Small business" data-yours="your business" data-hint="e.g. We are a two-van plumbing company and want more quote requests.">
            <span class="ph"><img class="lo" src="/images/v6/aud-small-business.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1280" height="853"><img class="hi" src="/images/v6/aud-small-business.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1280" height="853"></span>
            <span class="me"><svg class="ck" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="5 12.5 10 17 19 7" pathLength="1"/></svg>This is me</span>
            <span class="dtx"><span class="h">Small businesses</span><span class="w">Shops, trades, restaurants, studios and local services.</span></span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="door" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-aud="in" data-slug="individual" data-label="Individual" data-yours="your work" data-hint="e.g. I am a bookkeeper going independent and need a simple site.">
            <span class="ph"><img class="lo" src="/images/v6/aud-individual.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1280" height="853"><img class="hi" src="/images/v6/aud-individual.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1280" height="853"></span>
            <span class="me"><svg class="ck" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="5 12.5 10 17 19 7" pathLength="1"/></svg>This is me</span>
            <span class="dtx"><span class="h">Individuals</span><span class="w">Freelancers, consultants, creators and people starting out.</span></span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="door" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-aud="sp" data-slug="specialist" data-label="Specialist business" data-yours="your practice" data-hint="e.g. We run two physio clinics and intake is still on paper.">
            <span class="ph"><img class="lo" src="/images/v6/aud-specialist.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1280" height="853"><img class="hi" src="/images/v6/aud-specialist.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1280" height="853"></span>
            <span class="me"><svg class="ck" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="5 12.5 10 17 19 7" pathLength="1"/></svg>This is me</span>
            <span class="dtx"><span class="h">Specialist businesses</span><span class="w">Clinics, legal and accounting, manufacturers, nonprofits.</span></span>
          </button>
      </div>
      <p class="swipe" aria-hidden="true">Swipe to see all three<svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M221.66,133.66l-72,72a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.69,136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H196.69L138.34,61.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l72,72A8,8,0,0,1,221.66,133.66Z"/></svg></p>
    </div>
    <div class="path" data-path="sb">
      <div class="pl afade">
        <h3>A site that takes bookings or quotes, then local search and ads.</h3>
        <p>Most small businesses lose customers between finding you and contacting you. We fix that path first, then bring more people to it.</p>
        <a class="pill p-dk" href="#r5contact">Get a plan<span class="ar"><svg class="pi a1" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg><svg class="pi a2" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg></span></a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <ol class="steps">
            <li><span><b>A site that books</b><span class="d">Booking, quote or order forms that reach your phone, not a shared inbox.</span></span><span class="dv lbl">Build</span></li>
            <li><span><b>Found on the map</b><span class="d">Google Business Profile, hours, photos and reviews set up properly.</span></span><span class="dv lbl">Market</span></li>
            <li><span><b>A steady ad budget</b><span class="d">Small, local campaigns in your own account, aimed at the work you want.</span></span><span class="dv lbl">Market</span></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="need"><b>What we'll ask you for</b><span><svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg>Your logo and any photos</span><span><svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg>Your service area</span><span><svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg>Who answers enquiries</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="path" data-path="in" hidden>
      <div class="pl afade">
        <h3>A personal site on your own domain, and photos that look like you.</h3>
        <p>When someone hears your name, they look you up. A clear page with your work, your rates and a way to reach you does the selling for you.</p>
        <a class="pill p-dk" href="#r5contact">Get a plan<span class="ar"><svg class="pi a1" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg><svg class="pi a2" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg></span></a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <ol class="steps">
            <li><span><b>Your own domain</b><span class="d">yourname.ca and a matching email address, yours for good.</span></span><span class="dv lbl">Build</span></li>
            <li><span><b>One clear page</b><span class="d">What you do, who it is for, examples, and how to book you.</span></span><span class="dv lbl">Build</span></li>
            <li><span><b>Photos that look like you</b><span class="d">A short portrait session and words written with you.</span></span><span class="dv lbl">Create</span></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="need"><b>What we'll ask you for</b><span><svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg>Three examples of your work</span><span><svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg>A short bio</span><span><svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg>An hour for photos</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="path" data-path="sp" hidden>
      <div class="pl afade">
        <h3>Intake, catalogues or giving pages built around the rules of your field.</h3>
        <p>Specialist work has rules: privacy, advertising standards, part numbers, receipting. We design around them so your staff are not working around the site.</p>
        <a class="pill p-dk" href="#r5contact">Get a plan<span class="ar"><svg class="pi a1" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg><svg class="pi a2" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M200,64V168a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V83.31L69.66,197.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L172.69,72H88a8,8,0,0,1,0-16H192A8,8,0,0,1,200,64Z"/></svg></span></a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <ol class="steps">
            <li><span><b>Map how work arrives</b><span class="d">An hour with your front desk or sales team before any design.</span></span><span class="dv lbl">Build</span></li>
            <li><span><b>Forms that ask less</b><span class="d">Intake, booking or quote forms that collect only what you need.</span></span><span class="dv lbl">Build</span></li>
            <li><span><b>Reach within the rules</b><span class="d">Search and ads checked against your field’s advertising rules.</span></span><span class="dv lbl">Market</span></li>
        </ol>
        <div class="need"><b>What we'll ask you for</b><span><svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg>Your current forms</span><span><svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg>Any advertising rules you follow</span><span><svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/></svg>One person who signs off</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="svc" id="r5svc" aria-labelledby="r5svc-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="shead" data-rv>
        <h2 class="sh" id="r5svc-h">Four services, one team.</h2>
        <p class="sub">Open a line to see what is included, and pick the ones you want for the form below.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
                  <details class="row" id="build">
