  <section class="faq wrap" id="r5faq" aria-labelledby="r5faq-h">
    <div class="fgrid">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px" data-rv>
        <h2 class="sh" id="r5faq-h">Questions people ask first.</h2>
        <p class="sub">Anything else, ask in the form below.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fqs">
        <details class="fq" name="r5faq" open><summary>I work for myself. Is this too much for me?<svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>No. Plenty of work starts with one page, your own domain and a profile people can find. You can add more later without starting over.</p></details>
        <details class="fq" name="r5faq"><summary>Do you work with regulated fields like health or law?<svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>Yes. Intake forms ask only what you need, and ad copy is checked against your college or society's advertising rules before it runs.</p></details>
        <details class="fq" name="r5faq"><summary>Can you work with the site I already have?<svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>Yes. We look at what is there first and tell you what is worth keeping. A rebuild is only suggested when fixing costs more.</p></details>
        <details class="fq" name="r5faq"><summary>Do I need all four services?<svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>No. Most clients start with one. The benefit of one team is that the next piece fits the last without a handover between agencies.</p></details>
        <details class="fq" name="r5faq"><summary>How do I find out the price?<svg class="pi" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>After a short call you get a written plan with a fixed price. Nothing starts until you have agreed to it.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

